  "title": "Easy Apple Dumplings",
  "description": "This easy apple dumplings recipe makes sweet biscuit-wrapped apples that float in a buttery vanilla and cinnamon sauce. Delicious with ice cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
